    "body": "This is a follow-up to #288.\r\n\r\nCurrently, as I couldn't figure out a way to handle the `loaders` key in a non-js config file, I disabled it altogether for that use case.\r\n\r\nThis is an appeal to the community to supply ideas on how this could work.\r\n\r\nA basic idea could be using the extensions of the default loaders, and loading separate files for custom ones. But I'm not sure how ergonomic that would be.",
